[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0010","text":"锵锵！今天我带了慰问品来～！\n蜂蜜柠檬渍！不嫌弃的话请尝尝～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0020","text":"哦哦，谢啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0030","text":"非常感谢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0040","text":"对恢复疲劳正合适呢！\n谢谢你，智代子！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0050","text":"没事没事……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0060","text":"──啊，那个\n蜂蜜柠檬渍是什么呀……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0070","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0080","text":"果穗，第一次听说吗？蜂蜜柠檬渍呢，就是把\n蜂蜜淋在柠檬上──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0090","text":"────反了！\n是柠檬泡在蜂蜜里啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0100","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
